  "description": "Tricky root sections, flowing trails, steep climbs. The HAIBIKE ALLMTN 2 is your ticket to a world of limitless all-mountain possibilities. A bike that opens up every route. Thanks in part to its mountain-ready all-round equipment, which has been comprehensively updated for the new season: with 160mm travel front and rear, wide Continental knobbly tyres and a mixed wheel setup – 29\" at the front, 27.5\" at the rear – you’ll cruise confidently over any downhill obstacle while still enjoying perfect traction on steep climbs. The powerful Bosch Performance Line CX motor helps you tackle even the steepest gradients. Plus the 800Wh battery ensures you can fully enjoy electric tailwinds even on long tours. In short: with this eMTB, you’ll experience serious off-road fun – no matter how challenging the terrain.",
